# Duet-1024 AVX512

Status: retained for Duet-1024 v2 on x86 AVX512.

Each row packs six columns into one AVX512 register. The permutation uses the
v2 S-box, AVX512 row permutations, precomputed `l64` rotate-count tables,
`_mm512_rolv_epi64`, and `vpternlogq` for the final three-way XOR.

See `../Evaluation_Report.md` for validation commands and benchmark results.
